{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07648","headline":"寒食 · 孟云卿","name":"寒食","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二月江南花满枝，他乡寒食远堪悲。\n贫居往往无烟火，不独明朝爲子推。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟云卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「寒食」条，撰者周啸天、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"周啸天"}